// Lookout variation for CE Restored's Smugglers' Cove adaptation.
{1}{Keep your voice down. Sound carries across the water, and some ships aren't welcome here.}{Keep your voice down. Sound carries across the water, and some ships aren't welcome here.}{}{}{}{}
{2}{What are you watching for?}{}{5}{}{10}{}
