{10}{Tarant patrols, rival crews, and captains who still think we owe them money. Mostly gulls, but gulls have never tried to hang me.}{Tarant patrols, rival crews, and captains who still think we owe them money. Mostly gulls, but gulls have never tried to hang me.}{}{}{}{}
{11}{Is the road through the woods safe?}{}{5}{}{20}{}
