{20}{Safer than the deep woods, worse than the dock. Stay on the approach and don't pick a fight with anything furrier than you are.}{Safer than the deep woods, worse than the dock. Stay on the approach and don't pick a fight with anything furrier than you are.}{}{}{}{}
